INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(6921,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8488021','Screening for autosomal recessive and X-linked conditions during pregnancy and preconception: a practice resource of the American College of Medical Genetics and Genomics (ACMG).','Gregg AR, Aarabi M, Klugman S, Leach NT, Bashford MT, Goldwaser T, Chen E, Sparks TN, Reddi HV, Rajkovic A, Dungan JS; ACMG Professional Practice and Guidelines Committee.','2021','panethnic neurosensory customs amish hutterites tsd tsd predate closes replaces mlpa interrogated interrogations interrogating clinicalgenome refuted expressivity expressivity interrogated narrowest prepregnancy socioeconomical villus interrogated euler ascribe admixture ideologies ancestors intermixing conveys pleiotropy reserving hassle medlineplus hbb xpc xeroderma pigmentosum oculocutaneous albinism cyp21a2 phenylketonuria tnxb tenascin hexa gjb2 nonsyndromic nonsyndromic dhcr7 lemli opitz atp7b aspa canavan acadm acyl nphs1 pmm2 fktn warburg slc26a4 pendred ercc2 cerebrooculofacioskeletal trichothiodystrophy photosensitive dync2h1 polydactyly decimal hba1 hba2 smn1 panethnic hps1 hermansky pudlak hps3 hermansky pudlak elp1 dysautonomia fxn friedreich dld dihydrolipoamide neb nemaline clrn1 usher blm rican smn1 elp1 dysautonomia blm smn1 pseudogene smn2 artifactually smn1 globin hba1 hba2 artifactually elp1 blm friedreich trinucleotide gaa fxn rican acadvl acyl argininosuccinate aciduria evc2 chondroectodermal arsa metachromatic leukodystrophy mvk igd mevalonic aciduria pkhd1 btd biotinidase alpl hypophosphatasia hypophosphatasia bbs1 bardet biedl clcn1 myotonia cyp27b1 polg mccc2 methylcrotonyl carboxylase mlc1 megalencephalic acat1 methylacetoacetic aciduria cc2d2a joubert meckel slc26a2 epiphyseal achondrogenesis homocystinuria nonresponsive lrp2 donnai barrow idua mucopolysaccharidosis hurler mucopolysaccharidosis hurler scheie fkrp dystroglycanopathy dystroglycanopathy rnaseh2b aicardi goutieres rars2 pontocerebellar dec