 ] [ Google Scholar ] [15]. Zhao X, Wu M, Zhang D, et al. The relationship of interpersonal sensitivity and depression among patients with chronic atrophic gastritis: the mediating role of coping styles. J Clin Nurs 2018. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [16]. Moher D, Shamseer L, Clarke M, et al. Preferred reporting items for systematic review and meta-analysis protocols (PRISMA-P) 2015 statement. Syst Rev 2015;4:1. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [17]. Cumpston M, Li T, Page MJ, et al. Updated guidance for trusted systematic reviews: a new edition of the Cochrane Handbook for Systematic Reviews of Interventions. Cochrane Database Syst Rev 2019;10:1–2. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [18]. Lunn DJTA, Best N, et al. WinBUGS: a Bayesian modelling framework: concepts, structure, and extensibility. Stat Comput 2000;10:325–37. [ Google Scholar ] [19]. Puhan MA, Schunemann HJ, Murad MH, et al. A GRADE Working Group approach for rating the quality of treatment effect estimates from network meta-analysis. BMJ 2014;349:g5630. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [20]. Zhao Z, Yin Z, Wang S, et al. Meta-analysis: The diagnostic efficacy of chromoendoscopy for early gastric cancer and premalignant gastric lesions. J Gastroenterol Hepatol 2016;31:1539–45. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [21]. Badle A. Long-term follow-up after endoscopic resection of gastric superficial neoplastic lesions in Portugal. Endoscopy 2014;46:933–40. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [22]. Lim H, Jung H, Park Y, et al. Discrepancy between endoscopic forceps biopsy and endoscopic resection in gastric epithelial neoplasia. Surg Endosc 2014;28:1256–62. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [23]. Ho SWT, Tan P. Dissection of gastric cancer heterogeneity for precision oncology. Cancer Ence 2019;110:1–6. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [24]. Xu J, Shen W, Pei B, et al. Xiao Tan He Wei Decoction reverses MNNG-induced precancerous lesions of gastric carcinoma in vivo and vitro: Regulation of apoptosis through NF-(B pathway. Biomed Pharmacotherapy 2018;108:95–102. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [25]. Zhao Y, Li B, Wang G, et al. Dendrobium officinale polysaccharides inhibit 1-Methyl-2-Nitro-1-nitrosoguanidine induced precancerous lesions of gastric cancer in rats through regulating Wnt/β-catenin pathway and altering serum endogenous metabolites. Molecules (Basel, Switzerland) 2019;24:1–4. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [26]. Tang X, Zhou L, Zhang S, et al. Randomized double-blind clinical trial of Moluodan for the treatment of chronic atrophic gastritis with dysplasia. Chin J Integrative Med 2016;22:9–18. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [27]. Liu C, Chen J, Chang X, et al. Comparative metabolomics study on therapeutic mechanism of electro-acupuncture and moxibustion on rats with chronic atrophic gastritis (CAG). Sci Rep 2017;7:14362. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [28]. Xia L, Yanli Z. Effect of group psychotherapy on quality of life and emotional state of patients with gastric cancer. Doctor 2018;3:97–8. [ Google Scholar ]',40232,'2025-10-20 06:32:22','2025-10-20 06:32:22');
