INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(6969,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5932820','Multiplicity and molecular epidemiology of Plasmodium vivax and Plasmodium falciparum infections in East Africa.','Zhong D, Lo E, Wang X, Yewhalaw D, Zhou G, Atieli HE, Githeko A, Hemming-Schroeder E, Lee MC, Afrane Y, Yan G.','2018','multiclonal pricked merozoite msp1 pyro pvmsp1 pfmsp1 multiclonal lowland s12936 merozoite spraying artemisinin malarial malarial malarial malarial merozoite msp mitochondrion apicoplast malariae msp2 pvmsp1 cambodian sixfold unquestionably multiclonal torrent merozoite msp1 pfmsp1 intraspecies pvmsp1 multiclonal microsatellites jimma asendabo jimma jimma oromia jimma asendabo arenado jimma schoolchildren lowland highland kombewa kendu lowland iguhu kaimosi highland lowland perennial hyperendemic highland mesoendemic pricking jimma sym asendabo sym asendabo asym iguhu sym iguhu asym iguhu asym kaimosi asym kendu asym kombewa sym kombewa asym kombewa asym sym asym pvmsp1 pfmsp1 saponin chelex ribonucleic 18s pvmsp1 pfmsp1 appended barcode appended af435593 nc_004330 msp1 pvmsp1 icbs hatched portillo pfmsp1 hatched primestar gxl takara pakchong 342g 3d7 102g barcode sequalprep carlsbad pvmsp1 pfmsp1 seekdeep amherst baileylab umassmed seekdeep seekdeep fastq trimming barcodes msp1 pvmsp1 hsd mafft mafft cbrc bioedit dnasp amova genalex upgma itol itol embl popart qscores seekdeep pakchong 3d7 seekdeep pvmsp1 mg657437 mg657457 pfmsp1 mg675458 mg675556 pvmsp1 h09 h11 h14 h16 h43 h76 pvmsp1 msp1 hapf minp pvmsp1 h00 h87 bracket pfmsp1 pvmsp1 asymptote multiclonal microsatellites pat3 pat3 h013 pat1 h002 pat1 h029 pvmsp1 pvmsp1 superscripts hsd shard asendabo jimma asendabo kombewa iguhu kombewa lowland iguhu highland highland iguhu kaimosi lowland kombewa kendu kombewa lowland iguhu kaimosi kendu kombewa kendu msp1 msp2 glurp pvmsp1 multiclonal multiclonal sustains highland lowland lowland kombewa kendu multiclonal multiclonal multiclonal lowland msp1 multicl